WEBVTT

00:11:27.917 --> 00:11:32.021
I knew exactly where I was going
and where to find everything on my list.

00:11:32.055 --> 00:11:37.060
So I set off in the truck,
in a T-shirt and jeans and flip-flops,

00:11:37.093 --> 00:11:39.529
dark glasses and a baseball cap.

00:11:39.529 --> 00:11:40.863
And it didn't matter.

00:11:40.863 --> 00:11:43.900
I was outed by the manager
in the very first aisle.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.168
“Good morning, governor!

00:11:45.201 --> 00:11:47.403
Welcome to the Home Depot.
How can I help you?"

00:11:48.638 --> 00:11:53.843
I encountered a man in the checkout line
who was red-hot mad.

00:11:54.677 --> 00:11:59.015
You know, not hostile or threatening,
just really angry and loud,

00:11:59.048 --> 00:12:00.383
and he let me have it.